      "source_sha256": "e264df52cb7e6f7f4d057d04d3c7d65387499c8c96a28778f9571a5697b7a488",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "帝之起凤翔也，悉取天平节度使李从严家财甲兵以供军。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "3274234a-cb8f-56fd-a35d-edd1b92c7609",
