      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-07/sources/library/xinwudaishi-040-li-congyan-return/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "62c20c5fdc94a9d4e47c84f1e23d0fc8275db8a7ca6853207b91682417d3702c",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "廢帝起鳳翔，將行，鳳翔人叩馬乞從曮。廢帝入立，復以從曮為鳳翔節度使，"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "357dbbd6-cc52-5f8a-93a6-3c0458a36024",
